        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "Hi {{ $json.body.full_name }},\n\nWelcome to MiForge! We're glad you found us via {{ $json.body.source }}.\n\nYour first visit is booked under the {{ $json.body.tier }} plan. When we arrive we'll agree on a flat price before we start, and we'll leave you a one-page cheat sheet.\n\nIf anything comes up before then, just reply to this email or call us.\n\n- The MiForge team"
      },
      "id": "791ba9cf-c8ff-4165-a83a-3e9ba3d74ec8",
